Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:40.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, guys, listen. I go over there and,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:40.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我讲  总之我去找他 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.45,0:00:43.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- you know, I'm... - Why? What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.45,0:00:43.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-然后...  -为什么  我哪里不好
