Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm sorry. I thought you said it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  你不是说没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I said what was okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是  那时候是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when I thought she was some weird bald chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为她是个光头怪女人 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That girl has got hair all over her head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是她满头都是头发
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:25.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it won't work out. Maybe Ross won't like her personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:25.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许不能成  说不定罗斯不喜欢她的个性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:27.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why, does she have a bad personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:27.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的个性不好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:29.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, Bonnie's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:29.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  邦妮最随和了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:41.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Read your CompuTek proposal. Real home run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:41.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看过你的企划案了  非常精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:45.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Barely got you that time. Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:45.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}差点就打中了  站过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:47.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:47.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:49.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah! Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:49.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:52.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was a good one. Keep at it, team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:52.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这次表现得很好  要保持
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What is with him? - "With him"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他是怎么搞的  -怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're his favorite. You're his guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是他的爱将  你是他的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:09:59.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We never get smacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:09:59.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们从没被打过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not true. He smacked you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没这回事  他打过你一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:06.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not on purpose. He ricocheted off you and got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:06.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是巧合  他打完你之后弹到我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, I need some smacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉你  我需要被打
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got a kid starting Dartmouth in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的小孩秋天要去达特茅斯念书了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:14.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dartmouth? Who went to Dartmouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:14.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}达特茅斯  谁去了达特茅斯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:15.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dartmouth sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:15.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那里逊毙了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You go to Dartmouth? Bing?  -No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要去达特茅斯吗  宾  -不是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:29.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, Ross! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:29.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  罗斯  那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:31.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Ultimate Fighting Combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:31.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}终极格斗超值餐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:34.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I saved 30 cents. Plus, I get to keep the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:34.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我省了30美分  杯子还不用还
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From New York City, New York...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这位来自纽约州  纽约市
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:43.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...appearing in his Ultimate Fighting Championship debut...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:43.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首次参加终极格斗冠军赛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... he's known for his confrontational business style!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在商场上以强硬著称
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:51.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ladies and gentlemen, introducing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:51.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女士们先生们  让我们欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.97,0:10:54.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... Pete Becker!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.97,0:10:54.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}彼特·贝克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:01.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love you, Pete!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:01.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}彼特  我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:09.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And his opponent, from Huntington Beach, California...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:09.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的对手来自加州亨丁顿滩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... he's a 300-pound streetfighter...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重达300磅的街头搏击好手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Tank Abbott!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坦克·艾博特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pete?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}彼特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pete?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}彼特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That guy's pretty huge. - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那家伙好魁梧  -你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:37.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hoshi taught me how to use an opponent's strength and weight against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:37.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保志教我用他的力量和体重反击他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then that guy is in serious, serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家伙的麻烦大了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right! You go get him! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去吧  打倒他  加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go gentlemen, here we go! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两位  来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you ready? Then let's get it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备好了吗  开战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:22.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:22.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:24.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:24.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:29.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I just tell you how proud I am of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:29.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我有多为你骄傲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:34.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It would be nice after hearing 20,000 people chant,"You suck!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:34.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听完两万人骂我逊后  你这句话真窝心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought you were nuts at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我原本觉得你疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... but you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now you can just look back at this thing with no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你可以了无遗憾  微笑回顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}微笑回顾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you're not gonna get going are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是还要继续打吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:51.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well let me ask you a question. Am I the Ultimate Fighting Champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:51.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我问你一件事  我是终极格斗冠军吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:54.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, no. But
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:54.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna stop until I'm the Ultimate Fighting Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不当上终极格斗冠军  我绝不罢休
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:03.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That guy stood on your neck until you passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:03.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家伙踩着你的脖子  直到你昏迷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:05.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me tell you a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:05.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉你一个故事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I set out to create MOSS 865, 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我着手研发的摩斯865 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:11.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}do you think it happened overnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:11.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以为是一夕成功吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. There was MOSS 1 that burned down my dad's garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  摩斯一代烧毁我爸的车库
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There was MOSS 2 that would only schedule appointments in January.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩斯二代只能排一月的行程表
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And 862 others that I learned from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}此外还有862次的失败经验
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:24.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just like I learned from this fight, 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:24.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像我从这场比赛学到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:26.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}never to let a guy stand on my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:26.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝不能让对手踩我的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't know that already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你之前不知道的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm gonna get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着  我会越来越强
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:35.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay? I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:35.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗  我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:41.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just get a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:41.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要强很多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且还要快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:46.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:46.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hoshi thinks you being ringside may have affected my concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保志认为你在场边  会影响我的注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:54.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. That was the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:54.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  这才是问题所在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.37,0:14:04.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How long until Pete's fight? - About five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.37,0:14:04.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-彼特的比赛几点开始  -还有五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:06.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right now they're interviewing his opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:06.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在他们在访问他的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:09.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, he trains by going to lran and pulling the arms off thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:09.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然  他的训练方式是去伊朗拔断小偷的手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hot dog? - Four, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-来根热狗  -四根
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm really nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:23.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So Ross, how umm, how did it go with Bonnie?
