Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:08.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的脊椎骨不能动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please tell me you're stopping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托告诉我你要放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine. I'd fight tonight if they'd let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事  今晚要我上场都行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:20.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, see this circle I'm marking off here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:20.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看我划出的这个圆了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is my Zone of Terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的"恐怖区"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:29.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are insane! You've got to give this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:29.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了  你一定要放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:32.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't until I'm the Ultimate Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:32.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非我拿到终极格斗冠军  不然没门
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:35.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you. The day will come 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:35.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你说  总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:38.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when children will argue over who will win a fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:38.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小朋友会争辩我和超人...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:40.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...me or Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:40.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会打赢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:44.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not that I could beat Superman, but kids are stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:44.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然赢不过超人  不过小孩子都很笨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:47.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:47.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你先坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:49.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:49.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:51.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are terrible at this,okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:51.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打得很烂  
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:54.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are the worst Ultimate Fighter ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:54.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是史上最烂的终极格斗手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:56.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:56.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最烂的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:20:01.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a torn rotator cuff, a hairline fracture in my right forearm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:20:01.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的肌腱套破裂  右前臂有轻微骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:06.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and a severely bruised Adam's apple, but that really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:06.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喉结严重瘀伤  但都没你话来得伤人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:14.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:14.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么  你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:20.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I care about you too much to watch you hurt yourself like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:20.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我太爱你  没办法看你这样伤害自己
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So if you have to do this, you'll have to do it without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是你非打不可  我就不奉陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:26.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're asking me to quit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:26.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你要我放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:29.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then you're asking me to be someone I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:29.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是要我违背本性
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:32.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:32.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我非打不可
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:37.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:37.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:41.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:41.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:48.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Monica. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:48.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莫妮卡  -怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you leave a note? I'm on a lot of painkillers now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以留张字条吗  我服了大量止痛药
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.17,0:20:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I don't know ifI'll remember this tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.17,0:20:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怕明天会不记得这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, in conclusion, the lines all go up, so I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总而言之  节节上升  我很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.48,0:21:06.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great job, team! Tomorrow at 8:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.48,0:21:06.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大伙干得好  明天八点半见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:10.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phil, nice job! Stevens, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:10.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲尔  干得好  史蒂芬  漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:13.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goldberg, you maniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:13.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}戈博  你这个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:14.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:14.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:21.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Bing! Good job, couldn't have done it without ya. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:21.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-宾  没有你可不行  -谢谢  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.62,0:21:22.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.62,0:21:22.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:26.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I forgot my briefcase ,you know, by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:26.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我忘了拿公事包  这是意外
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:29.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, you did. Forgot something else too, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:29.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然是意外  你还忘了一件事  混小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:35.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:35.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:37.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not feeling left out, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:37.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会觉得被冷落了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.93,0:21:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, not at all. That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.93,0:21:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点也不会  开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:45.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everybody else got one, and you want one too. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:45.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都有  你也想来一下  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:52.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, get on out of here, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:52.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:59.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pete Becker circles the ring now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:59.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}彼特·贝克绕着格斗场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:01.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Looks like he's just trying to feel him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:01.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}似乎想弄清楚自己的情势
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:03.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Bruiser is charging! - Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:03.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-"魁梧男"进攻了  -逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.29,0:22:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Run, you crazy, rich freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.29,0:22:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快逃啊  死变态有钱人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.97,0:22:09.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I can't watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.97,0:22:09.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:11.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check it out, he's winning! Pete's winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:11.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看  他要赢了  彼特要赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.13,0:22:13.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.13,0:22:13.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗  -假的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.33,0:22:17.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-oh, Bruiser has Becker on the canvas 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.33,0:22:17.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"魁梧男"把贝克打倒在地 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and is going for his favorite area!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}向他最喜欢的部位进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:25.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait! If that's his favorite area, why is he being so mean to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:25.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然是最喜欢的部位  为何要下这种毒手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:27.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:27.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是讽刺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.95,0:22:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your last boyfriend, Richard, didn't want to have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.95,0:22:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的前任男友理查德不想生小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And from the looks of it, now Pete can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}按现在来看  彼特是不能生了
